## About this version

The official text of Directive (EU) 2022/2555, published in the Official Journal of the European Union on 2022-12-27. The directive entered into force on 16 January 2023 and was to be transposed into member states' national law by 17 October 2024.

## Scope

This version replaces the NIS Directive (EU) 2016/1148 and extends coverage to more sectors, with a new classification of essential and important entities.
